@participant20 
Not working for me. I'm using the 2046 version. The pod has been installed properly after that I'm getting the error while installing the build.

Does anyone have a solution that is working and not mentioned here?

@participant25 do you have flipper enable ? If yes then just comment following line ` :flipper_configuration => flipper_config` you will probably not getting any error after setting `use_modular_headers!`. Otherwise please share more details regarding run time errors.

I have successfully installed expo and some expo's library to my current react native project by doing this:-
`set globally use_modular_headers! ,  disable flipper`
